  "changes": [
    "Private Classic identifier; raised compact frame and immediate mouse-down feedback.",
    "Only URL and absolute filename icons are sent to Image; symbolic names remain resolved by Kirigami.Icon.",
    "Disabled icon hover recoloring; Classic hover and pressed feedback remains in the button frame.",
    "Panel content uses six-pixel padding and an aspect-preserving glyph limited to 32 logical pixels; Planar icon geometry stays unchanged.",
    "Panel outer sizing retains the old transversal/Huge extent and native icon or file aspect instead of measuring the reduced glyph; the original caption fitting is measured separately.",
    "Only panel content translates one pixel while the existing MouseArea is pressed; click, cancellation, keyboard, DND and the native 250ms drag-open interaction remain intact.",
    "Panel captions fit inside the inset content using their existing font and native minimum; ellipsis is only a fallback and never feeds outer sizing.",
    "Custom extreme-aspect images retain aspect-fit inside both glyph bounds, with space for the pressed offset; a 16px minimum icon-containing panel extent prevents degenerate one-pixel buttons. Ordinary tested panel dimensions and Planar sizing are retained."
  ],
